    <node id="DOC_ep_2026-03-26_item003.txt_S34">
      <data key="d0">SEGMENT</data>
      <data key="d1">lexical_graph</data>
      <data key="d4">Valdis | Dombrovskis: We take note and appreciate a wide spectrum of views in this House. This is not an easy debate, but I welcome that there is an overall recognition of the importance of the EU-US trading relationship, and that moving ahead is the best step we can take for our citizens, workers and firms. As we approach the vote shortly, I would once again underline that we recognise the validity of the points which have been taken up by the European Parliament and that we are ready to work constructively in the trilogues to see how to address them in the best manner possible. At the same time, we will continue to engage with our US counterparts, raising our concerns where necessary, working together on issues of mutual concern where possible, and laying the foundations for further and future engagement.</data>
      <data key="d5">66</data>
      <data key="d2">Valdis | Dombrovskis...</data>
      <data key="d6">{}</data>
    </node>
